        "procedure": "Compounds 1–3 were obtained by mixing [Ni2(μ-OH2)(O2CtBu)4]·(HO2CtBu)4 (0.1 mmol), [Ln2(O2CtBu)6(HO2CtBu)6] (0.075 mmol; Ln = Gd for 1), and H2O3PCH2Ph (0.1 mmol) in MeCN (8 mL) and stirring at room temperature for a few minutes. The slurry was transferred into a 10 mL Teflon-lined autoclave, heated at 150 °C for 12 h, then cooled to room temperature at 0.05 °C min−1. Block-shaped crystals of 1 formed from the reaction.",
