      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "Ni6Gd6 cage 1 is not an SMM (no slow relaxation down to 1.8 K) but shows a large magnetocaloric effect. Room-temperature χMT is 55.3 emu K mol−1 (calcd 54.1). χT stays nearly constant to 100 K, rises to 57.0 emu K mol−1 at 14 K, then falls to 46.1 emu K mol−1 at 2 K. Magnetization saturates at 55.3 μB (7 T, 2 K). Magnetic entropy change −ΔSm = 26.5 J kg−1 K−1 at 3 K for ΔH = 70 kG, approaching the maximum 37.4 J kg−1 K−1 expected for six NiII (s = 1) and six GdIII (s = 7/2).",
        "measurements": [
